WEBVTT

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:24.030
Thor!

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:26.460
Wait, Thor!

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.690
Thor!!

00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:32.670
It'd be bad for you to argue; you should calm down!

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:35.370
Third!

00:01:38.650 --> 00:01:39.670
Oi, Thor!

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:46.340
Thor!

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.970
How cruel, all of a sudden.

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:51.720
The cruel one is you.

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:53.930
I never said I wanted a Try!

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:56.880
It's impossible for me to beat Top!

00:01:58.380 --> 00:01:59.650
You're certainly anxious, aren't you.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:04.510
You hit me this hard but only made my mouth bleed.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.340
What you're saying is so pitiful.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.590
I'm opposing it after careful consideration!

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:15.780
Then, how many years will it take before you can win?

00:02:17.410 --> 00:02:20.470
If you can't win now, you won't be able to years later either.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:23.290
You are my comrade.

00:02:23.920 --> 00:02:26.630
Top will get rid of anyone associated with me...

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:28.730
Then why don't you do it?!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:30.590
I'm just a Third.

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:32.520
This fact won't change.

00:02:35.080 --> 00:02:37.100
I chose you as my Top.

00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:44.190
Generally, for a child raised in a pure environment like the Colony, the chances of surviving here are close to zero.

00:02:44.770 --> 00:02:46.170
But you survived.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:49.070
You were caught up in Musa's germination,

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:50.850
and even a Verasona's attack,

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.180
but you managed to survive.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:53.940
This was luck?

00:02:54.470 --> 00:02:57.670
No, not just luck.

00:02:57.820 --> 00:02:58.950
We can say that this is fate.

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.050
I've been waiting for a person like you;

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:06.020
a survivor here on Chimera, who'll become Jyu Oh

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.440
and one day stop Odin.

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.400
Why?

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:16.160
I was in Rhea's Air Force Official School.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.710
I was abandoned here by Odin as well,

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:22.430
without even having a formal trial.

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:25.260
Odin... Why?

00:03:25.740 --> 00:03:26.830
Dr Klein.

00:03:28.020 --> 00:03:31.300
Your father aimed to overthrow Odin's dictatorship,

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:35.720
but everyone involved was killed before they could achieve their goal.

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.970
As Colin said, your father was killed over a false accusation.

00:03:39.170 --> 00:03:40.070
That's!..

00:03:41.840 --> 00:03:43.920
You have a responsibility to become Jyu Oh;

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:48.680
overthrowing Odin was your father's intention as well.

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:54.480
Thor, I think Third is right.

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:55.530
Tiz...

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.430
So you have to become Jyu Oh,

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:01.270
and then get to Hecate as soon as possible.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:03.770
If not...

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:06.900
Tiz, I understand.

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:08.820
Thank you.

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:09.780
Thor...

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.540
But Third,

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.240
we can see who will take the match:

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.760
the difference between their strength and build is huge.

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:19.070
So when the time comes, leave creating the turning point to me.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:25.350
Tomorrow you will be fighting here.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:28.410
Many people will come to watch you.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.960
Once the duel starts, it won't stop until victory and defeat are determined.

00:04:32.570 --> 00:04:34.390
There won't be anywhere for you to run.

00:04:35.310 --> 00:04:37.560
However, only that corner...

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:40.360
That corner is a blind spot.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:42.560
A blind spot?

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:45.920
Listen, you have to lead him there.

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:49.070
The timing has to be accurate.

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:54.020
Lead him there when he's about to win so that he's off guard.

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.700
He will definitely stop there.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:04:59.700
I'll make him stop.

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:04.400
There's only one chance; grab it tightly.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.960
This is the turning point;

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:09.330
your only chance of winning.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.120
Only... chance.

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:16.940
If you can't take it, you'll die.

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:33.480
Are you scared?

00:05:34.290 --> 00:05:35.340
I am.

00:05:35.970 --> 00:05:37.370
I'm not confident at all.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:41.190
No matter how many turning points there are, nonsense is nonsense.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:43.360
Thor, you just need to be confident!

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:44.540
There's a reason you should be too...

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:47.240
The current Top was Jyu Oh's brother,

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.930
so he didn't become Top by a Try;

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:51.790
Jyu Oh nominated him.

00:05:52.320 --> 00:05:54.650
Among the four Tops, he's the weakest.

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:57.300
You're good with swords as well.

00:05:57.710 --> 00:06:00.600
Most importantly, you survived Verasona's attack.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.470
There's noting you need to be afraid of.

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:05.210
You will definitely win!

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:07.770
Win and become Jyu Oh!

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:20.460
This is?

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.460
It's Leaf Fall.

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:25.060
Musa's Leaf Fall has started.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.190
Leaf Fall?

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:33.920
When Leaf Fall begins, it's Kou no Tsuki.

00:06:34.390 --> 00:06:37.040
Women start to nominate their husbands.

00:06:37.460 --> 00:06:38.630
Then, it's dusk.

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:41.890
After that, a big storm will start.

00:06:42.190 --> 00:06:43.890
When all the leaves have fallen, night will come.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:48.940
After a long long day, there's a long long night;

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.910
Chimera's most cruel period.

00:06:55.320 --> 00:06:59.070
I never thought I'd see a night filled with darkness again.

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.000
That night's just ahead of me.

00:07:04.360 --> 00:07:07.250
Still, I have to face this test.

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:08.700
Thor...

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.440
But this is what Papa would have wanted.

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:28.090
<i>Wow!</i>

00:07:29.900 --> 00:07:33.070
<i>He's coming!</i>

00:07:35.400 --> 00:07:39.610
<i>It feels like I've seen this scene before.</i>

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:43.560
<i>That's right, it was from the Earth Library;</i>

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.830
<i>there, horned beasts and men fought against one another.</i>

00:07:53.180 --> 00:07:57.460
Didn't run away, huh? You really are an idiot.

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:06.200
Don't imagine you'll die easily; I'll make you suffer first.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:09.930
Prepare yourself!

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:14.020
Thor...

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.730
This Try is completely ridiculous!

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:20.120
Isn't there anything we can do to stop it?

00:08:21.290 --> 00:08:22.460
There's no use.

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:24.080
It's already gone this far.

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:28.430
Besides, this is Top's character. No one will be able to...

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.670
Where's Third at a time like this?

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:35.490
That guy said that he cares about Thor...

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:39.410
Yeah,.. well, that's true...

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.440
Such a villainous character.

00:09:03.760 --> 00:09:07.470
You understand the role you're playing, don't you, Top.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:20.290
Nevertheless, it's better for you to leave the stage quickly once your part is over.

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.380
Ready, fight!

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.510
I'm coming, brat!

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:04.450
Thor!

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:06.630
I'm coming!

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:26.440
Shit, you're pretty swift.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:31.590
Nice! Thor!

00:10:34.740 --> 00:10:37.260
Stop running around.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.530
<i>I can't touch his sword. I'm won't be able to block his attack.</i>

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.220
You damn brat!

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:45.760
What?

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.940
<i>Well done! Run, run!</i>

00:10:49.140 --> 00:10:52.770
This little bastard, trying to make a fool of me...

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:59.700
Good he got away. With normal reflexes, he wouldn't have been able to escape that attack.

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:04.760
I don't want to interfere in other Ring's Try,

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.610
but it'd be a pity if this kid dies here.

00:11:10.990 --> 00:11:13.060
<i>He's really a lot stronger than Chen.</i>

00:11:13.580 --> 00:11:15.810
<i>Continuing to run away won't work!</i>

00:11:16.190 --> 00:11:19.110
Brat! You have nowhere to run!

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:23.120
<i>Not yet; I have to make him angrier.</i>

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:25.550
I'll definitely kill you!

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:34.370
Shit!

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:36.150
<i>A bit more.</i>

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:42.030
Bastard!

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:43.370
<i>Now!</i>

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:00.210
I won't forgive you. Let me cut you up!

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:01.370
<i>No...</i>

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:05.830
<i>I have to go there.</i>

00:12:06.000 --> 00:12:07.920
Thor, it's too early!

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:09.420
<i>Get there...</i>

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:26.790
Heh, you've finally become obedient.

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:31.930
Ow...

00:12:32.610 --> 00:12:34.290
Thor, get up!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:35.880
Stand up and run!!!

00:12:36.780 --> 00:12:37.590
Tiz...

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:52.850
You really are tough. Good, do what you like.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.460
Just run then!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:58.340
<i>The worst...</i>

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:03.060
<i>This is the worst nightmare I've ever had.</i>

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:08.660
<i>I'm going there...</i>

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:13.600
<i>there... there... I have to get there...</i>

00:13:14.550 --> 00:13:16.000
Can't we do anything about it?

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.380
Thor.

00:13:20.190 --> 00:13:24.520
<i>A bit... just a bit more...</i>

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:33.830
What?

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:37.140
Can't run anymore?

00:13:39.630 --> 00:13:41.300
Ready to die?

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:46.140
<i>Third... where's Third?</i>

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:49.050
<i>Liar...</i>

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:51.480
<i>Third's a liar.</i>

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:53.710
<i>He betrayed me?</i>

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:02.420
<i>There's only one chance; grab it tightly.</i>

00:14:24.180 --> 00:14:27.040
Thor... you did it!

00:14:35.950 --> 00:14:36.740
<i>Red...</i>

00:14:39.280 --> 00:14:42.080
<i>Everywhere is red...</i>

00:14:43.370 --> 00:14:49.530
<i>Is it my blood?... Or... the blood of someone I killed?..</i>

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:59.870
Thor! Thor!

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:02.090
Hang in there, Thor!

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:06.950
I tried my best, but his bleeding was excessive.

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:09.960
I'm not sure if he can make it to tomorrow...

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.560
That's a lie! Thor won't die.

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:15.570
He'll become my husband!

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:17.730
He definitely won't die!

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:20.040
Tiz...

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:25.140
Ah! It's gone - his pulse!

00:15:25.970 --> 00:15:26.600
Thor!

00:15:27.590 --> 00:15:28.410
What are you doing?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:30.590
He needs artificial respiration and heart massage.

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:34.300
I'll do the artificial respiration; Colin taught me before.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:36.860
Okay. Chen, feel the pulse.

00:15:42.090 --> 00:15:42.790
Can you feel it?!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:44.240
Not yet.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:49.930
Wake up Thor!

00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:51.420
Open your eyes!

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.390
It's too early to die!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.110
You won't die, right?

00:15:58.820 --> 00:16:00.490
You'll become Jyu Oh!

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.310
That's your destiny!

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:03.220
Third!

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:04.150
Let go of me!

00:16:04.370 --> 00:16:05.180
Thor is...

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:06.970
The pulse is back!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.180
Thor's breathing...

00:16:19.680 --> 00:16:22.790
Really, what a tough guy.

00:16:43.240 --> 00:16:43.940
Third.

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.190
A portent of the big storm...

00:16:49.170 --> 00:16:50.650
If you want to go back you should hurry.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:55.270
The Try with Ilza is officially arranged.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:01.440
If I die, will you cry a bit for me?

00:17:02.430 --> 00:17:04.860
I'll cry. Of course I will.

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:11.990
Then, when that happens, like you were for Thor, will you be desperate to save me?

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:16.500
I will win!

00:17:17.230 --> 00:17:18.690
- win and come back!

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:22.390
And then, next Kou no Tsuki I'll nominate you.

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:26.990
That time... when that time comes, don't run away, Third!

00:17:36.460 --> 00:17:37.410
<i>Night is coming.</i>

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:41.170
<i>Everything will freeze over.</i>

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:43.970
<i>The 181 days of deathly night:</i>

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.200
<i>Chimera Death Night.</i>

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:56.200
<i>It always feels like I'm in a nightmare.</i>

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:01.290
<i>When I open my eyes, Papa, Mama and Rai will be with me;</i>

00:18:01.990 --> 00:18:04.310
<i>we'll all be together in our house on Juno.</i>

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:09.310
<i>But reality is always different.</i>

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:14.430
Rai! Wait, Rai!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:17.560
I can't. I have to go.

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:20.420
No, don't go!

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:24.090
Don't worry, you're strong, Thor!

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:25.840
You'll be fine by yourself.

00:18:26.730 --> 00:18:28.370
I'm not strong!

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:30.060
I'll be scared on my own!

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.160
Don't go!

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:35.370
Please, Rai!!!

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:37.820
Rai!

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.500
Thor, are you ok?

00:18:42.400 --> 00:18:43.130
Tiz...

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.850
Were you having a bad dream?

00:18:46.530 --> 00:18:47.670
You cried out.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:51.240
I... didn't die?

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:55.460
No. However, there were many times when I almost gave up hope...

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.280
but Third...

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:58.340
Third?

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:03.930
Yeah. Without Third, you would've died.

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.570
Were you with me all this time?

00:19:09.010 --> 00:19:10.280
Of course I was.

00:19:11.220 --> 00:19:13.620
I'm... your Second.

00:19:14.310 --> 00:19:15.050
Tiz...

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.570
Oh, you woke up, Thor.

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:25.510
Here, take this.

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:28.250
Ochre Ring's Top's symbol.

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.300
I don't want it.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:34.280
I hated that guy,

00:19:35.320 --> 00:19:38.720
but I didn't mean to kill him.

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:44.150
Ok. Whatever Top wants.

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:47.020
Third... uh...

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:50.660
What... those clothes?..

00:19:51.360 --> 00:19:52.820
It's already night.

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:56.830
While you were sleeping all this time, night fell.

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:58.300
Night?...

00:20:02.390 --> 00:20:04.100
<i>Since I was abandoned on Chimera,</i>

00:20:04.610 --> 00:20:06.250
<i>I've had many dreams of my past.</i>

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:08.960
<i>Every time when I woke,</i>

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:10.650
<i>I'd feel sad and hurt,</i>

00:20:12.610 --> 00:20:17.790
<i>But for the first time I feel that reality here on Chimera isn't so bad.</i>

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:23.430
<i>Maybe I can survive here together with Tiz and Third...</i>

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:27.410
<i>All the same, I'll leave this planet</i>

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:31.250
<i>and became Jyu Oh, without a doubt.</i>

00:20:36.450 --> 00:20:37.150
Top!

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:40.370
Top, I've been looking for you.

00:20:40.850 --> 00:20:42.530
You can even find me here, huh.

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:44.820
Karin said that you'd be here.

00:20:45.070 --> 00:20:45.890
Is that so...

00:20:46.060 --> 00:20:49.310
Top, it won't be long before the blizzard picks up force.

00:20:49.940 --> 00:20:51.150
What are you doing here?

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.390
Kevin, address me as you used to;

00:20:56.410 --> 00:20:57.460
Call me Zagi.

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:00.800
Take a good look...

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:01.880
Eh?

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:06.860
Ochre Ring, sooner or later, will be my territory.
